# Ministry Call Center — Execution Blueprint

## Workflow: Opus Plans → Flash Builds

**Your role (Opus):** Review output after each sprint, catch RLS bugs, design drift, integration gaps.  
**Flash's role:** Execute sprint files verbatim. Each file is self-contained.

---

## Sprint Execution Order & Thinking Levels

| Sprint | File | Thinking | Est. Time | Dependencies |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | `00-design-system.md` | — | Reference only | None |
| 0.1 | `sprint-0.1.md` | **LOW** | 30 min | None |
| 1.1 | `sprint-1.1.md` | **MEDIUM** | 45 min | 0.1 |
| 1.2 | `sprint-1.2.md` | **HIGH** | 60 min | 1.1 |
| 2.1 | `sprint-2.1.md` | **MEDIUM** | 45 min | 1.2 |
| 2.2 | `sprint-2.2.md` | **LOW-MEDIUM** | 45 min | 2.1 |
| 2.3 | `sprint-2.3.md` | **HIGH** | 90 min | 2.2 |
| 3.1 | `sprint-3.md` (first half) | **LOW** | 30 min | 2.2 |
| 3.2 | `sprint-3.md` (second half) | **MEDIUM** | 45 min | 3.1 |
| 4.1 | `sprint-4.md` (agent dash) | **MEDIUM** | 45 min | 3.1 |
| 4.2 | `sprint-4.md` (admin dash) | **MEDIUM** | 60 min | 4.1 |
| 5.1 | `sprint-5-and-7.md` (WhatsApp) | **LOW** | 30 min | 2.2 |
| 5.2 | `sprint-5-and-7.md` (Prayer) | **LOW** | 20 min | 2.2 |
| 7.1 | `sprint-5-and-7.md` (Hardening) | **HIGH** | 60 min | All above |
| 7.2 | `sprint-5-and-7.md` (Launch) | **LOW** | 30 min | 7.1 |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Between each sprint**, you (Opus) should review the output, check for:
> 1. RLS violations (test with two agent accounts)
> 2. Design token adherence (gold accents, dark theme, not default shadcn)
> 3. Missing error handling (toasts, validation)
> 4. Responsive breakpoints working

## Deferred to Phase 5+ (not in scope for MVP)
- Sprint 4.3: India geo heatmap (choropleth)
- Sprint 4.4: Data quality dashboard
- Sprint 6: Telephony integration (requires separate budget/KYC)

## Files Location
All sprint specs are in: `c:\Users\vbans\Documents\Call Center Web App\sprints\`

## How to Prompt Flash

Template prompt for each sprint:
```
Read the sprint spec file at [path].
Also read the design system file at sprints/00-design-system.md.
Execute this sprint exactly as specified.
Use the existing codebase in c:\Users\vbans\Documents\Call Center Web App\.
Report: what you built, any issues encountered, and the Definition of Done checklist with pass/fail for each item.
```
